  <item>
    <title>没有爆款的2024年，有哪些小众日剧值得补一补？（年末盘点/个人向）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6780fd34d6a4b57e143c7daa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6780fd34d6a4b57e143c7daa</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 10 Jan 2025 11:06:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家吼！又到了年初喜闻乐见的日剧大盘点时间啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年的排名真的好纠结好纠结，直到开始剪视频还改了一次文稿...主要的原因有两点：一是今年“较为优秀”的作品，优秀的程度都差不多，二是可能受限于本人的口味（？），怎么感觉它们题材也都差不多ε=(´ο｀*)))</span></p><span></span><p><span>大体都是温情向的主题，不过借由奇幻、婚姻（和不结婚）、悬疑等等类型来包装，我想大概今年真的特别需要治愈一下吧。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlTbbJeabMBIRX9skE6akxOOOwer.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>本期节目时间线</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 序幕 | 本年度关键词：守护</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">01:16</a> #10 反正与我无关~某律师的真实工作~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">03:07</a> #9 狮子的藏身处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="316">05:16</a> #8 辣妹刺客everyday（或译“宝宝刺客everyday”）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> #7 柚木家的四兄弟、住宅区的两人（并列）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">09:16</a> #6 全领域异常解决室</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="681">11:21</a> #5 1122好夫妇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="799">13:19</a> #4 不合适也要有个限度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="924">15:24</a> #3 擅长捉弄的高木同学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1014">16:54</a> #2 春天来临时</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1132">18:52</a> #1 编舟记~我要编纂辞典~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1281">21:21</a> 尾声 | 特别致敬</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你有不在榜上、想要安利给大家的宝藏剧目，请在留言区告诉我！本视频中的排名纯主观，带少量剧透（已标注），欢迎友好讨论哦~~~</span></p><span></span><p><span>沐见汐 参上</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64eaf3ef80c9ec4c5f617e5e/ln3FBoD9HZ6m5LpLqJgl_Y3RPTOU.m4a" length="44921697" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:23:15</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtzrTGa5jucOPu71ZLRofuLCtcAh.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>24年后,《角斗士2》实现了质的倒退（无剧透有彩蛋）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/675074b117cd5416ad825d1c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">675074b117cd5416ad825d1c</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Dec 2024 15:31:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>东京首映后，朋友说我脸都气红了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>于是国内上映，我又去看了一遍，然后尽量理智地复盘了一下，这部和前作对比怒打0分的《角斗士2》，到底哪里问题最大。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>防杠预警：整期视频的分析，都是两部《角斗士》的对比！！</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>沐见汐 参上</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiyDqPpEbrIAuhLrKY-YeF3Npke2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>本期节目时间线</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 序幕 | 整体评价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">01:36</a> 主角设计的失衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="249">04:09</a> 反派的双重拆解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="406">06:46</a> 女性角色的倒退</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a> 剧作缺陷与导演执念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="682">11:22</a> 尾声（有彩蛋哦）</span></p>]]></description>
