    <pubDate>Fri, 26 Jul 2024 15:56:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqmNgu8uGrlCuKQD1bsgkDl0BDF4.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>大家好，欢迎来到</span><strong><span>“海边放映室X奥运会”</span></strong><span>特别节目！</span></p><span></span><p><span>其实沐见汐老早就想做一期“运动题材”的影视盘点了，这次正好借奥运的契机，抓到了百忙之中的从业者朋友DanDan和琛琛，还有“心怀不轨”的节目老朋友Sylvia，一起来安利我们喜欢的影&amp;视&amp;动画作品！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在第一次沟通时，发现大家的片单真的很不一样，然后定下了本期的关键词——</span><strong><span>破壁</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为运动，是</span><strong><span>不断超越、破除天花板</span></strong><span>的过程。</span></p><span></span><p><span>而分享，是</span><strong><span>不断丰富见闻、打破茧房</span></strong><span>的过程。</span></p><span></span><h2><em><span>P.S.节目涉及（无伤大雅的）剧透！</span></em></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>本期节目时间线</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 序幕&amp;会关注的奥运项目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="283">04:43</a> 推荐平时做的运动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 美国电影《弱点》(美式橄榄球)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1267">21:07</a> 日本动漫《排球少年》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1759">29:19</a> 日本动漫《乒乓》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2297">38:17</a> 日本电影《惠子，凝视》(拳击)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2754">45:54</a> Netflix纪录剧集《环法自行车赛：逆风飞驰》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3518">58:38</a> 尾声&amp;为中国队加油吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家评论区留言你喜欢的运动或者推荐的相关影视作品！</span></p><span></span><p><span>沐见汐 参上</span></p>]]></description>
