    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjKvNZckY2pRKyzQ6aVZQ_GGvXzR.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>大家好，欢迎来到“海边放映室”X上海国际电影节的第二期节目！</span></p><span></span><p><span>经历了第一轮片单的小小失望后，没想到上影节真的憋了大招！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>“上海日本电影节”真是实至名归hhhh</span></p><span></span><p><span>沐见汐已经目测到《柯南》《你的颜色》《黎明的一切》还有《阴阳师0》会是抢票求票热门了QAQ</span></p><span></span><p><span>更别提今天刚刚官宣的今敏两部修复神作了，希望大家都能看到心仪的新作和经典吧~~~</span></p><span></span><p><span>沐见汐 参上</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【第26届上海国际电影节日影介绍-第二期】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 序幕</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>霓虹映画单元（第二批）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="69">01:09</a> 佐藤嗣麻子《阴阳师0》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="136">02:16</a> 吉田惠辅《消失的女儿》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> 荒木伸二《惩罚循环》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">04:16</a> 近浦启《伟大的缺席》</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>主竞赛单元动画长片</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="313">05:13</a> 山田尚子《你的颜色》-亚洲首映</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>日本电影周</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="388">06:28</a> 关根光才《隐瞒之事》-国际首映</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="459">07:39</a> 三宅唱《黎明的一切》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="541">09:01</a> 尾声</span></p>]]></description>
