    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsXVcruRNC3NnMYWazkIw9halR9g.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>大家好，欢迎来到“海边放映室”上海国际电影节的特别节目！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期将会带来日影比较集中的“霓虹映画”和“名导新作”两大单元的部分影片介绍，如果是不能参与上影节的朋友，也可以把本期当做是2023年日本新片的分享^ ^</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然观众反馈今年的整体片单不够“炸裂”，但沐见汐在查完资料后依旧马克了几部值得购票在影院观看的佳作，在视频结尾处分享给大家！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【第26届上海国际电影节日影介绍】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 序幕</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>霓虹映画单元（第一批）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="71">01:11</a> 户田彬弘《市子》-东京国际电影节直通车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">02:13</a> 岸善幸《正欲》-东京国际电影节直通车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">03:12</a> 石井裕也《月》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="261">04:21</a> 前田哲《九十岁。有什么可喜可贺的》-世界首映</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="317">05:17</a> 山下敦弘《去唱卡拉OK吧！》</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>片中曲目表↓</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrKK3dT2Z5i1UyRjsK0DVT02kptu.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">06:17</a> 山下智彦《鬼平犯科帐 血斗》-海外首映</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>名导新作单元</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">07:23</a> 维姆·文德斯《完美的日子》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 滨口龙介《邪恶不存在》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="573">09:33</a> 岩井俊二《Kyrie之歌》</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家留言告诉我，你们会抢票的影片是哪部！</span></p><span></span><p><span>沐见汐 参上</span></p>]]></description>
